      "number": "1",
      "title": "Implementation",
      "body": "The document has been created and approved by the General Assembly of 29.11.2025.\nThe document and its rules will be implemented from the 2029 season (01/01/2029).\nCompetitors will have 3 seasons to align their equipment with this document and its rules.",
