    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.2",
      "title": "Bascinets with perforated side-pivoting attached visor",
      "body": "The term “Bascinets with perforated side-pivoting attached visor” will be abbreviated to “Side-pivoting Perforated Bascinets” for the remainder of the document.\n\nSide-pivoring Perforated Bascinets must have a visor with a rounded profile.\n\nSide-pivoring Perforated Bascinets are Approved for Transitional armors.\n\nSide-pivoting Perforated Bascinets are Denied for 14th century and 15th century armors.\n\nVindobonensis 2762, Wenzel Bible - 1389 - Austria\n\nWenceslas Bible - 1390/1400 - Germany",
