    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.4",
      "title": "Others",
      "body": "All helmets with perforated visors may be decorated in the spirit of medieval styles, such as orle, torse, decorated aventails (with copper/brass chainmail rings), vervelle covers and coat of arms badges etc.\nSuch decoration must be made in coherence with historical sources.\nUsing modern and/or offensive imagery and slogans is prohibited.",
